# Customer360 Navigator - Activation Layer Dockerfile.dockerignore
# Named `Dockerfile.dockerignore` (not `.dockerignore`) so BuildKit applies it to THIS Dockerfile
# only, matching every other service's own precedent. This image needs only two files from src/ -
# everything else is excluded.

data/
**/*.csv
**/*.parquet
notebooks/
models/
**/*.ipynb
**/*.ipynb_checkpoints/
reports/
docs/
powerbi/
tests/
.git/
